# recursion: : fact ( n -- n! ) dup 1 < if drop 1 else dup 1 - recurse * then ; 5 fact emit 0 fact 48 + emit 4 fact emit (a return code stack and a value stack as arrays; the chain words have one return link, no recursion)
:ma data 32 0
:mb data 32 0
:mr data 32 0
:dst array 5 8
:rst array 5 8
:dsp data 8 0
:rsp data 8 0
